    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 6.6</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="6.6" corresp="#wit-b">Gyf he man to deaðe gefylle, beo he ðonne uthlah, ⁊ his hente mid hearme ælc ðara ðe riht wylle.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="6.6" corresp="#wit-h">Gif he man to deaþe gefylle, beo he þonne útlah, ⁊ his hente mid hearme ælc þara þe riht wille.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="6.6" corresp="#wit-q">Si aliquem deiciat in mortem, sit utlaga (uel exlex), et prosequatur eum cum clamore omnis qui rectum amat.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#attenborough" n="6.6" corresp="#wit-h">Gif he man to deaþe gefylle, beo he þonne útlah, ⁊ his hente mid hearme ælc þara þe riht wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">If he strikes a man dead, he shall then be outlawed, and he shall be pursued with hostility by all those who wish to promote law and order.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn er jemanden zu Tode schlägt, dann sei er friedlos, und es fahnde auf ihn mit Gerüfte jeder derer, die Gesetzlichkeit wünschen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If he strikes someone dead, then let him be an outlaw, and let everyone who desires lawfulness pursue him with hue and cry.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
